{"id":"ta_che","lemma":"tâche","pos":"noun","rank":1690,"glosses":["task","assignment"],"ipa":"/taʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/81/Fr-t%C3%A2che.ogg/Fr-t%C3%A2che.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tâches"},"formAudio":{"tâches":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-t%C3%A2ches.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tâche de ne pas trop manger.","en":"Try not to eat too much.","words":[null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"too"},{"g":"to eat"}]},{"text":"Cette tâche a pris trois heures.","en":"This task took three hours.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"}]},{"text":"Je peux vous aider dans cette tâche.","en":"I can help you with that assignment.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to help"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Je dois faire mes tâches ménagères.","en":"I've got to do my chores.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to husband","l":"ménager"}]},{"text":"Ce n'est pas tâche facile.","en":"This isn't an easy task.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"easy, simple"}]}]}